# BusStop Frontend Authentication

## 1. Keycloak & Keycloakify
- Authentication is strictly managed via Keycloak.
- Custom Keycloak login pages and themes must be built using `keycloakify`.
- Do not use Clerk, Auth0, or other third-party SaaS auth providers.

## 2. Keycloak Adapter
- Integrate the `keycloak-js` client within an adapter in `src/lib/adapters/auth/`.
- Do not leak Keycloak-specific logic directly into React components. Create a `useAuth` hook that abstracts the Keycloak instance.

## 3. Protected Routes
- Route guards must verify authentication status via the Keycloak adapter before rendering protected pages.
- Handle token refresh and session expiration gracefully.
